
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For hair &amp; beauty salons</span>
        <h1>Fill your chair, not your DMs.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Every “how much for a cut and colour?” and “any space Saturday?” answered in seconds, from your own prices and open slots, while you’re busy with a client.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-salons-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="live-demo?sample=enquiries" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">See it answer one</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="painTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Where the day goes</span><h2 id="painTitle">The messages that eat your day.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>The same questions all day</h3><p>Prices, hours, “do you do…?”. Most messages need the same few answers, typed again between clients.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>Bookings lost while you work</h3><p>You can’t reply mid-colour. By the time you can, they’ve booked somewhere else.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>No-shows and gaps</h3><p>Reminders and “we have a gap at 2pm” messages that never get sent because nobody has the time.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="setTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What we&rsquo;d set up</span>
          <h2 id="setTitle">AI drafts the reply. You stay in charge.</h2>
          <ul class="tick-list">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Replies drafted from your price list, services and open slots</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Booking requests offered real times from your diary</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Anything unusual, a complaint or a big booking passed to you</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Reminders the day before, so fewer no-shows</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Optional: a simple website with prices, gallery and a Book button</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">It answers only from your own prices and rules. Anything it isn&rsquo;t sure about goes to a person.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="card card--link work-card reveal" href="live-demo?sample=enquiries">
          <img class="work-card__img" src="assets/shots/phone-chat.jpg" alt="" width="875" height="1073" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <div class="work-card__body">
            <div class="work-card__meta"><span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo</span><span class="tag tag--muted">Sample work, nothing is sent</span></div>
            <h3>A Saturday booking, answered</h3>
            <p>A client asks for gel nails on Saturday. The reply offers the open slots and the price, ready to send.</p>
            <div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">Run it yourself</span></div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">A fixed price before anything starts.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <ul class="price-list reveal">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Message and enquiry assistant<small>Replies drafted from your prices and diary, on WhatsApp and your website</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R25,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Keeping it running<small>We look after it, keep it accurate and send a monthly time-saved report</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R7,500<span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Customer email first?<small>The Inbox Assistant drafts routine email replies, paid only once it saves 5 hours a week</small></div><span class="price"><small>setup</small>R9,500</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Add a website<small>Prices, gallery, Book and WhatsApp buttons</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R12,500</span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>Not sure it&rsquo;s worth it?</h3>
            <p>That&rsquo;s what the free call is for. Tell us roughly how many messages and calls you get. We&rsquo;ll tell you honestly whether AI would save real hours, and if not, we&rsquo;ll say so.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points for typical salons. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list &rarr;</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 id="howTitle">From first call to answered messages.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Free 30-minute call</h3><p>You tell us what comes in and what eats your day. We say honestly whether AI fits.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>Fixed quote</h3><p>Exactly what it will do and what it costs. Nothing starts until you&rsquo;ve said yes.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Tested on real messages</h3><p>It drafts replies to your real enquiries first, so you see it working before it goes live.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Running, and measured</h3><p>We look after it and send you the time it saved each month.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions salons ask</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Does it reply by itself?</summary><p>Only if you want it to. Most salons start with drafts: the reply is written, you glance at it and press send. Routine answers can go out by themselves later.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Will it get my prices wrong?</summary><p>It answers only from the price list and rules you give us. Anything it isn’t sure about is left for you, never guessed.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do I still need a website?</summary><p>Not to start. If you want one, a salon site with prices, gallery and booking is an add-on from R12,500.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">More in the <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#faq">general FAQ</a>. Also for: <a class="inline-link" href="for-plumbers">Plumbers &amp; trades</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-restaurants">Restaurants &amp; takeaways</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-cleaners">Cleaning services</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">For hair &amp; beauty salons</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Tell us what takes too long.</h2>
        <p>A free 30-minute call. You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-salons-book-end">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
